Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.96,0:00:08.36,Narrator,Narrator,0,0,200,,從前有一個得到了一切的男人，\N傳說中的海賊王哥爾·D·羅傑。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.36,0:00:12.86,Narrator,Narrator,0,0,100,,他臨刑前的最後一番話，驅使人們駛向大海。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.86,0:00:14.63,Gold,Roger,0,0,0,,All my wealth and treasure?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.63,0:00:16.27,Gold,Roger,0,0,0,,It can be yours if you want!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.27,0:00:17.42,Gold,Roger,0,0,0,,Search for it!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.42,0:00:19.83,Gold,Roger,0,0,0,,I left everything in that one place.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.83,0:00:22.82,Narrator,Narrator,0,0,100,,人們現在為了追尋浪漫而揚帆出海。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.82,0:00:25.40,Narrator,Narrator,0,0,100,,世界進入了大海賊時代！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.86,0:02:31.10,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,快逃！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.94,0:02:34.88,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,咦？！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.88,0:02:36.27,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,這是什麼？！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.27,0:02:38.90,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,大家都在閃避！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.66,0:02:44.73,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,他們一定是被我們的軍事力量嚇到了！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.20,0:02:44.77,title,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,0)}The General From the Future Land and\NThe Crisis of Fishman Island's Destruction
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.73,0:02:47.86,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,那麼，趁現在瞄準敵方指揮官！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.64,0:02:51.35,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,前進！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.75,0:03:00.47,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,喂，喬巴指揮官！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.83,0:03:04.68,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,車子在顫抖！一定出了什麼問題！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.55,0:03:09.59,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,是陷阱！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.08,0:03:12.70,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,活該！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.34,0:03:16.81,Main,Daruma,0,0,0,,感覺如何？！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.02,0:03:19.19,Note,TL Note,0,0,100,,{\fad(10,100)}必殺達摩落
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.65,0:03:25.31,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,好痛⋯⋯
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.89,0:03:31.57,Main,Daruma,0,0,0,,我用牙齒把地面挖得到處是洞！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.54,0:03:37.74,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,{\i1}喂！怎麼回事？！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.74,0:03:41.20,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,{\i1}騙人布？！喬巴？！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.46,0:03:46.58,Main,Daruma,0,0,0,,現在，我也要讓那個騎車的白痴掉下去⋯⋯
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.55,0:03:54.02,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,{\i1}糟糕！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.02,0:03:57.33,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,{\i1}是陷阱！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.79,0:04:03.34,Main,Daruma,0,0,0,,{\i1}他是白痴嗎？！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.87,0:04:07.56,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,喂喂！你們沒事吧？！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.52,0:04:10.57,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,可惡！超不可原諒的！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.73,0:04:13.72,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,全員下車！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.72,0:04:15.15,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,為什麼？！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.24,0:04:19.07,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,喂！你在做什麼啊，佛朗基？！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.07,0:04:21.45,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,為什麼把坦克指揮官丟出去？！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.46,0:04:25.90,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,因為這是單人駕駛的載具！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.90,0:04:27.25,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,變形的時候到了！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.90,0:04:27.26,Note,TL Note,0,0,100,,{\fad(60,60)}Hentai：變形或變態
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.27,0:04:30.17,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,你本來就是變態了！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.17,0:04:33.24,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,黑犀牛FR-U 4！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.19,0:04:53.36,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,待命！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.02,0:04:56.62,Main,Usopp & Chopper,0,0,0,,變形了！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.62,0:04:58.90,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,我還沒結束！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.90,0:05:01.32,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,腕龍坦克5號！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.51,0:05:11.28,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,頭部更換！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.63,0:05:27.04,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,腕龍坦克5號！黑犀牛FR-U 4！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.04,0:05:29.70,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,合體！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.70,0:05:32.57,Main,Usopp & Chopper,0,0,0,,{\i1}什麼？！合體？！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.18,0:05:48.47,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,鐵之海賊！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.38,0:05:56.50,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,佛朗基將軍！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.12,0:06:02.17,Main,Usopp & Chopper,0,0,0,,{\i1}太棒了！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.17,0:06:04.65,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,{\i1}那到底是什麼鬼？！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.65,0:06:07.86,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,{\i1}好厲害！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.84,0:06:10.54,Main,Usopp & Chopper,0,0,0,,{\i1}耶！耶！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.54,0:06:13.19,Main,Usopp & Chopper,0,0,0,,{\i1}這就是我們夢寐以求的機甲合體！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.34,0:06:33.23,Thoughts,Franky,0,0,0,,貝加龐克，你這個我從未謀面的天才。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.74,0:06:38.78,Thoughts,Franky,0,0,0,,我看到了你畫的理論設計圖⋯⋯
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.78,0:06:43.48,Thoughts,Franky,0,0,0,,花了兩年艱辛的反覆試驗才完成。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.89,0:06:52.90,Thoughts,Franky,0,0,0,,利用了那種能適應形狀的合金，\N瓦波金屬，
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.06,0:06:57.55,Thoughts,Franky,0,0,0,,我把它變成了現實！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.55,0:07:01.04,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,別、別被他的虛張聲勢騙了！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.26,0:07:16.43,Main,Usopp & Chopper,0,0,0,,{\i1}好強！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.84,0:07:18.66,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,還不到驚嘆的時候！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.71,0:07:21.10,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,你們好好看看⋯⋯
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.10,0:07:23.60,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,掠奪者之劍！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.41,0:07:27.61,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,佛朗劍！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.63,0:07:29.73,Main,Usopp & Chopper,0,0,0,,{\i1}有劍！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.31,0:07:38.59,Note,TL Note,0,0,100,,{\fad(100,100)}足下：腳底
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.69,0:07:40.92,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,從下方攻擊？！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.34,0:07:43.50,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,太卑鄙了！太危險了！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.50,0:07:49.11,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,既然你飛到空中了，\N我的肩砲就來招呼你！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.89,0:07:53.76,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,{\i1}肩砲？！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.55,0:08:03.50,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,{\i1}是{\i0}你{\i1}在發射嗎？！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.62,0:08:05.68,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,話雖如此⋯⋯
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.58,0:08:05.68,Secondary,Chopper,0,0,0,,話雖如此⋯⋯
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.68,0:08:08.14,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,你好帥啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.22,0:08:11.90,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,可惡！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.90,0:08:13.97,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,真是個難纏的傢伙！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.10,0:08:18.69,Note,TL Note,0,0,100,,{\fad(100,100)}重身：重量
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.28,0:08:21.98,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,{\i1}我們被壓扁了！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.24,0:08:25.90,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,將軍你好帥！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.20,0:08:28.87,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,那哪裡帥了？！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.87,0:08:30.03,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,這是什麼？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.49,0:08:32.82,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,讓我發現弱者了嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.46,0:08:38.63,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,弱？太沒禮貌了！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.63,0:08:40.29,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,我只是膽小而已！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.30,0:08:48.38,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,小心陣風。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.73,0:09:01.36,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,現在明白了吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.56,0:09:05.29,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,這就是威瑟利亞的氣象科學。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.58,0:09:14.84,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,別小看它！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.27,0:09:22.03,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,欸？咦？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.75,0:09:23.86,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,喬巴去哪了？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.86,0:09:26.03,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,抓住他！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.03,0:09:30.12,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,可惡⋯⋯我被丟出坦克了。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.76,0:09:34.95,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,看來只好戰鬥了。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.11,0:09:37.54,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,但沒什麼好怕的！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.12,0:09:41.13,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,我已經不是以前那個弱小的我了！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.13,0:09:53.52,Note,TL Note,0,0,100,,{\fad(100,100)}竹槍叢林
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.69,0:10:00.03,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,海格力斯老師！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.78,0:10:03.18,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,我在那片森林裡度過了兩年，拼命求生。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.18,0:10:04.98,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,一秒都不能鬆懈！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.98,0:10:06.44,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,我不會忘記那段日子的！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.11,0:10:09.91,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,{\i1}現在開始！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.91,0:10:16.91,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,{\i1}男子漢騙人布冒險記的第二章！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.08,0:10:23.32,Main,Daruma,0,0,0,,我要在整個廣場布滿陷阱！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.32,0:10:25.78,Main,Daruma,0,0,0,,不管他們帶來機器人還是什麼都好。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.78,0:10:28.62,Main,Daruma,0,0,0,,一旦掉進洞裡，就完了！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.00,0:10:32.02,Main,Daruma,0,0,0,,什麼？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.26,0:10:35.64,Main,Daruma,0,0,0,,我聽到有其他人在地底挖掘⋯⋯
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.68,0:10:56.45,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,達摩被彈飛了！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.59,0:11:00.25,Main,Daruma,0,0,0,,你、你是誰？！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.79,0:11:03.19,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,是我啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.45,0:11:17.54,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,我也很擅長在地底挖掘！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.54,0:11:18.54,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,喬巴！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.81,0:11:24.60,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,好厲害！你學會變成鍬形蟲了嗎？！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.60,0:11:26.13,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,{\i1}我才不是甲蟲！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.76,0:11:32.33,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,這兩年我改良了我的變形型態。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.80,0:11:37.12,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,現在只有一種變形需要藍波球。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.16,0:11:41.70,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,其他型態我隨時都能切換！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.70,0:11:44.79,Main,Daruma,0,0,0,,你這個囂張的珊瑚混蛋！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.79,0:11:46.02,Main,Daruma,0,0,0,,我要把你撕碎！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.48,0:11:48.73,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,這不是珊瑚，是角！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.11,0:11:50.79,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,而且我⋯⋯
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.79,0:11:53.78,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,是一個囂張的{\i1}怪物！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.52,0:12:00.35,Main,Zeo,0,0,0,,你殺了多少人？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.21,0:12:04.27,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,零、零個⋯⋯
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.79,0:12:12.32,Main,Hody,0,0,0,,海怪！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.41,0:12:15.71,Main,Hody,0,0,0,,做得好，沒想到你還真做到了。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.40,0:12:20.91,Main,Hody,0,0,0,,他們信任你，你就抓住了白星。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.08,0:12:25.08,Main,Hody,0,0,0,,現在壓碎她！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.26,0:12:33.30,Main,Hody,0,0,0,,你的兄弟們還住在北極。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.05,0:12:36.65,Main,Hody,0,0,0,,我清楚知道他們在哪裡。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.22,0:12:41.79,Main,Hody,0,0,0,,我們隨時都能殺了他們。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.36,0:12:45.42,Main,Hody,0,0,0,,你們是傳說中的生物⋯⋯
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.42,0:12:48.48,Main,Hody,0,0,0,,就算是屍體也能賣個好價錢，\N你說是不是？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.10,0:12:55.43,Main,Hody,0,0,0,,你是在說這就是你想要的⋯⋯
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.36,0:12:57.78,Main,Hody,0,0,0,,海怪？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.20,0:13:05.25,Main,Jinbe,0,0,0,,難以置信⋯⋯他竟然威脅牠的兄弟來強迫牠服從？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.38,0:13:17.68,Main,Hody,0,0,0,,我最後再說一次！壓碎白星！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.79,0:13:30.02,Main,Shirahoshi,0,0,0,,小章大人！我、我不能呼吸了！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.54,0:13:43.45,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,小章！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.08,0:13:52.50,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,你為了保護兄弟們⋯⋯才成了他的奴隸嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.03,0:13:58.62,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,我明白了，你當然想保護他們。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.62,0:14:02.07,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,他們是你的弟弟妹妹？還是哥哥姐姐？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.23,0:14:06.98,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,讓我也一起保護他們吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.91,0:14:17.75,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,草帽來了！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.75,0:14:20.25,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,殺了他！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.52,0:14:25.01,Main,Dosun,0,0,0,,你過不去的-哆遜！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.01,0:14:27.88,Main,Ikaros,0,0,0,,交給我們-嗨！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.02,0:14:40.02,Main,Dosun,0,0,0,,草帽！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.12,0:14:43.53,Main,Ikaros,0,0,0,,我不會讓你靠近船長的-嗨！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.99,0:14:45.52,Main,Ikaros & Dosun,0,0,0,,{\i1}你是我的！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.74,0:14:49.97,Main,Zoro,0,0,0,,我不會讓你⋯⋯
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.89,0:14:52.34,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,擋住他！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.50,0:14:59.95,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,攔住草帽！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.71,0:15:05.39,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,咦？他消失了！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.39,0:15:06.29,Main,Hody,0,0,0,,什麼？！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.93,0:15:21.08,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,{\i1}我現在真的燃起來了！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.01,0:15:45.48,Main,Neptune,0,0,0,,糟了！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.95,0:15:51.61,Main,Neptune,0,0,0,,那是⋯⋯
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.43,0:15:55.30,Main,Neptune,0,0,0,,約定之船⋯⋯
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.91,0:15:58.05,Main,Neptune,0,0,0,,諾亞！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.91,0:16:07.78,Main,Neptune,0,0,0,,為、為什麼⋯⋯
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.82,0:16:10.29,Main,Neptune,0,0,0,,為什麼它在移動？！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.99,0:16:12.96,Main,Neptune,0,0,0,,誰做的⋯⋯怎麼做到的？！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.36,0:16:15.92,Main,Neptune,0,0,0,,太、太可怕了！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.67,0:16:20.01,Main,Fukaboshi,0,0,0,,怎麼了，父王？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.01,0:16:24.88,Main,Fukaboshi,0,0,0,,是的，這很奇怪，但您為什麼這麼激動？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.34,0:16:29.78,Main,Fukaboshi,0,0,0,,不過就是一些舊殘骸而已，沒什麼重要的。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.39,0:16:35.77,Main,Neptune,0,0,0,,你們錯了。\N絕不能讓那艘船出任何事-佳蒙！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.77,0:16:42.40,Main,Neptune,0,0,0,,在它的時代來臨之前，\N絕不能移動那艘船-佳蒙！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.32,0:16:55.13,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,乘地船長！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.13,0:16:58.87,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,他吃了那麼多能量類固醇\N變成了怪物，但是⋯⋯
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.55,0:17:01.26,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,不、不，你們看！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.14,0:17:13.05,Main,Hody,0,0,0,,草帽！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.48,0:17:15.85,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,他還真頑強啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.11,0:17:19.61,Main,Hody,0,0,0,,你知道魚人空手道能做什麼嗎？！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.61,0:17:21.49,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,他把他的頭打飛了！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.49,0:17:23.39,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,好！而且只用了一擊！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.37,0:17:28.01,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,那種攻擊對我沒用⋯⋯
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.01,0:17:29.43,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,因為我是橡膠人！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.43,0:17:33.04,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,跟吉貝爾的攻擊比起來，那根本不痛不癢！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.47,0:17:37.17,Main,Jinbe,0,0,0,,沒錯！就是因為你依賴假的力量！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.40,0:17:41.31,Note,TL Note,0,0,100,,{\fad(100,100)}頭部武裝
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.98,0:17:44.09,Main,Hody,0,0,0,,鐵殼中隊！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.32,0:17:48.79,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,你這個笨蛋！你的頭會碎掉的！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.57,0:17:55.89,Note,TL Note,0,0,100,,{\fad(60,100)}鐘
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.99,0:18:02.61,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,{\i1}鋼鐵輸給他的頭了！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.62,0:18:50.38,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,一發都沒打中？！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.38,0:18:52.83,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,他知道每一發的去向嗎？！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.83,0:18:54.96,Main,Shirahoshi,0,0,0,,你好厲害啊，魯夫大人！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.96,0:18:56.92,Main,Jinbe,0,0,0,,那是見聞色霸氣！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.95,0:19:25.29,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,{\i1}乘地船長！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.09,0:19:42.67,Main,Shirahoshi,0,0,0,,魯夫大人⋯⋯你到底有多強？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.30,0:19:46.72,Main,Fishman,0,0,0,,草帽魯夫太厲害了！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.72,0:19:50.85,Main,Fishman,0,0,0,,這就是世界聞名的海賊的力量嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.73,0:19:58.33,Main,Fishman,0,0,0,,什麼？！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.33,0:20:00.62,Main,Fishman,0,0,0,,那、那是⋯⋯
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.62,0:20:04.67,Main,Fishman,0,0,0,,魚人街的諾亞！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.67,0:20:08.23,Main,Fishman,0,0,0,,為什麼諾亞會在魚人島上方？！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.23,0:20:11.18,Main,Fishman,0,0,0,,它明顯正朝著廣場墜落！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.59,0:20:14.54,Main,Fishman,0,0,0,,它會打破島嶼周圍的泡泡！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.54,0:20:17.62,Main,Fishman,0,0,0,,沒有泡泡的話，魚人島就會被毀滅！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.62,0:20:18.94,Main,Fishman,0,0,0,,我們全都會被沖走！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.44,0:20:23.08,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,那是什麼？！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.08,0:20:24.08,Main,Jinbe,0,0,0,,諾亞？！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.28,0:20:30.78,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,超級巨大的！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.78,0:20:34.96,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,如果那艘船撞到我們，整座島都會被壓碎！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.96,0:20:37.22,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,誰在操控它？！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.22,0:20:40.75,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,不，諾亞根本不應該有動力才對！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.75,0:20:43.45,Main,Brook,0,0,0,,那是什麼？！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.45,0:20:44.40,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,好大！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.40,0:20:47.97,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,我不知道發生了什麼事，但我們完蛋了！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.97,0:20:50.43,Main,Robin,0,0,0,,我在想，如果我們全部同時被壓扁⋯⋯
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.43,0:20:52.55,Main,Robin,0,0,0,,海洋會變紅嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.55,0:20:55.43,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,別說這種可怕的話觸霉頭！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.43,0:20:57.49,Main,Fishman,0,0,0,,撤退！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.49,0:20:59.31,Main,Fishman,0,0,0,,逃到島外的海域去！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.53,0:21:17.30,Main,Shirahoshi,0,0,0,,大、大家⋯⋯
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.88,0:21:20.04,Main,Shirahoshi,0,0,0,,那是什麼？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.81,0:21:41.14,Main,Wadatsumi,0,0,0,,哎喲⋯⋯我滑倒了。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.14,0:21:44.81,Main,Zeo,0,0,0,,你是⋯⋯乘肯的手下，瓦達茲米！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.86,0:21:52.26,Main,Wadatsumi,0,0,0,,乘肯船長！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.26,0:21:55.19,Main,Wadatsumi,0,0,0,,我掉下來了！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.19,0:21:58.41,Main,Wadatsumi,0,0,0,,求求你停下船！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.41,0:22:00.75,Main,Wadatsumi,0,0,0,,我不想死！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.75,0:22:04.71,Main,Zeo,0,0,0,,乘肯？！到底怎麼回事？！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.79,0:22:07.79,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,乘地船長！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.79,0:22:09.85,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,你沒事吧？！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.85,0:22:13.34,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,呃，這是⋯⋯計劃的一部分嗎？！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.34,0:22:17.17,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,看起來乘肯在操縱那艘船！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.55,0:22:22.27,Main,Hody,0,0,0,,閉嘴，你們這些沒用的蛆蟲！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.70,0:22:25.27,Main,Hody,0,0,0,,可惡的草帽⋯⋯
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.27,0:22:29.16,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,咦？他怎麼還站著？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.16,0:22:31.07,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,我明明用了武裝色攻擊他。
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.74,0:22:41.75,Main,Hody,0,0,0,,乘肯嗎？那個瘋狂的海賊！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.75,0:22:44.71,Main,Hody,0,0,0,,這不在計劃之內！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.29,0:23:04.03,Main,Decken,0,0,0,,白星！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.03,0:23:07.08,Main,Decken,0,0,0,,接受⋯⋯我的愛吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.60,0:23:21.44,Main,Wadatsumi,0,0,0,,乘肯船長！那我怎麼辦？！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.59,0:23:25.96,Main,Decken,0,0,0,,瓦達茲米？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.96,0:23:29.42,Main,Decken,0,0,0,,已經不可能救你了！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.42,0:23:35.27,Main,Decken,0,0,0,,你將成為白星之死的祭品，\N就跟魚人島其他人一樣！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.27,0:23:36.33,Main,Wadatsumi,0,0,0,,不會吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.25,0:23:44.08,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,完了！泡泡撐不住了！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.08,0:23:46.21,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,這就是終點了！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.21,0:23:49.58,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,欸，白星公主去哪了？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.58,0:23:50.93,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,她不見了！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.55,0:23:55.88,Main,Jinbe,0,0,0,,什麼？公主！白星公主！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.93,0:24:01.44,Main,Decken,0,0,0,,什麼？白星消失了？！
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.44,0:24:03.52,Main,Jinbe,0,0,0,,不、不可能！
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.24,0:24:06.18,Main,Shirahoshi,0,0,0,,我在上面！
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.41,0:24:10.85,Main,Fishman,0,0,0,,白星公主！
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.85,0:24:11.89,Main,Fishman,0,0,0,,她什麼時候⋯⋯
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.89,0:24:13.83,Main,Brook,0,0,0,,人魚公主？！
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.83,0:24:16.99,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,白星！她在上面做什麼？！
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.99,0:24:21.28,Main,Jinbe,0,0,0,,那艘船基本上是朝著白星飛去的！
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.37,0:24:24.51,Main,Decken,0,0,0,,我深愛的女人！
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.20,0:24:30.41,Main,Shirahoshi,0,0,0,,我、我的命才是你的目標，對吧？！
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.78,0:24:34.51,Main,Shirahoshi,0,0,0,,如果你只是想要我的命⋯⋯
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.51,0:24:38.09,Main,Shirahoshi,0,0,0,,那就不應該牽連龍宮王國的人民。
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.76,0:24:40.71,Main,Shirahoshi,0,0,0,,拜託你，放過他們！
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.93,0:24:45.00,Main,Shirahoshi,0,0,0,,我就在這裡！
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.42,0:24:49.17,Main,Fishman,0,0,0,,{\i1}公主！白星大人！
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.06,0:24:54.51,Main,Hody,0,0,0,,所以基本上，那個瘋狂的乘肯⋯⋯
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.11,0:24:59.95,Main,Hody,0,0,0,,打算把整座島連同我們一起壓碎。
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.55,0:25:04.12,Main,Hody,0,0,0,,他背叛了我！
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.41,0:25:10.88,Main,Fishman,0,0,0,,啊，她要為了我們犧牲自己！
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.88,0:25:13.08,Main,Fishman,0,0,0,,我們就沒有辦法幫助她嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.42,0:25:21.57,Main,Decken,0,0,0,,噢，多麼⋯⋯
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.35,0:25:27.11,Main,Decken,0,0,0,,噢，多麼美麗啊，白星！連你的心靈都散發著光輝！
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.12,0:25:33.13,Main,Decken,0,0,0,,你想獨自一人化解這場災難\N拯救你的國家嗎，白星？
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.29,0:25:38.86,Main,Decken,0,0,0,,白星！
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.16,0:25:46.42,Main,Decken,0,0,0,,白⋯⋯星。
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.59,0:25:52.83,Main,Decken,0,0,0,,你確實配得上\N成為班德·乘肯九世的妻子！
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.22,0:26:00.98,Main,Decken,0,0,0,,在你最美的時刻死去，永遠活在我心中吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.98,0:26:03.07,Main,Decken,0,0,0,,白星！
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.39,0:26:07.06,Main,Fishman,0,0,0,,公主殿下！
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.22,0:26:19.43,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,那個弱星⋯⋯\N我都叫她待在我身邊了！
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.78,0:26:22.19,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,草帽他⋯⋯
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.19,0:26:24.19,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,乘地船長！
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.19,0:26:27.07,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,咦？乘地不在這裡！
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.51,0:26:30.72,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,看天上！他在那裡！
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.81,0:26:33.75,Main,Pirate,0,0,0,,在諾亞下面？！
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.61,0:26:50.75,Main,Hody,0,0,0,,你完全瘋了，班德·乘肯。
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.75,0:26:53.55,Main,Hody,0,0,0,,不過，這是一張絕妙的王牌！
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.99,0:27:19.38,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,那個混蛋⋯⋯竟敢傷害白星！
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.38,0:27:21.19,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,香吉士，等一下！
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.72,0:27:25.09,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,我跳上去！你負責這裡的廣場！
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.09,0:27:26.59,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,明白！
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.21,0:27:30.83,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,不過魯夫，那艘船是在水裡啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.16,0:27:33.84,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,你覺得船裡面也有水嗎，吉貝爾？
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.84,0:27:38.41,Main,Jinbe,0,0,0,,我不確定，但乘肯是惡魔果實能力者⋯⋯
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.41,0:27:42.21,Main,Jinbe,0,0,0,,所以我們可以推測船裡某處一定有空氣，因為他能讓船移動。
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.21,0:27:44.02,Main,Jinbe,0,0,0,,你要去的話，帶上這個。
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.04,0:27:47.15,Main,Jinbe,0,0,0,,這是能製造泡泡的珊瑚。
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.75,0:27:48.86,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,好！
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.65,0:27:58.48,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,好，我心愛的白星就交給你了！
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.48,0:28:00.03,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,我把你彈上去，魯夫！
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.83,0:28:04.89,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,來吧！
Comment: 0,0:00:25.40,0:00:25.40,Narrator,,0,0,0,,
